            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Argentina, 1923</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Martita's birthday is coming, and Luciano still doesn’t know how to do the Tango! Can he learn the tango in time to win the heart of the woman he loves?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a rhythm game that plays like a Latin American soap opera, full of love, melodrama, and knife fights. Set in the twilight of the tango era, with an original soundtrack by Latin American band YIRA.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story mode takes about 45 minutes, a short, complete melodrama you can finish in one sitting. Then come back for the per-song Challenges and Classic Mode, where the real mastery begins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >96% positive reviews on Steam. Recommended by Rock Paper Shotgun.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No rhythm required. Only heart.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/21b66f7cf405b7845d561ecb9a486e8e.poster.avif?t=1792521382\" width=540 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/21b66f7cf405b7845d561ecb9a486e8e.webm?t=1792521382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/21b66f7cf405b7845d561ecb9a486e8e.mp4?t=1792521382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn in seconds, master in hours: Anyone can pick up the basics. Nailing every step to the rhythm is another story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dance to the beat: Move Luciano across the floor, one step at a time, or slide through the whole stage if you dare.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every song teaches a new move: Master them to boost your score and earn every star.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love story, tango-style: A melodramatic romance set in 1923 Argentina, told the way only a telenovela can.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 original tango songs by YIRA: A modern tango soundtrack performed by a Latin American band.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short story, long mastery: Finish the main story in about 45 minutes. Then chase every star in Challenge Mode and Classic Mode.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And the cats. You'll understand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/147f781ed753d6bc15e9a15d7441e219.poster.avif?t=1792521382\" width=540 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/147f781ed753d6bc15e9a15d7441e219.webm?t=1792521382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701380/extras/147f781ed753d6bc15e9a15d7441e219.mp4?t=1792521382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
